    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Doom Scythe",
    "summary": "When the Doom Scythe picks a target for the heavy death ray, the enemy player chooses one outcome. The target can stand firm. Or it can duck for cover. Against a unit that stands firm, the ray scores Critical Hits on unmodified rolls to Hit of 5+. If the unit ducks, its models take −1 on their [Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls). That penalty expires as your next [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) starts.",
